    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">60 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case study</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 13 of 18</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Stock Exchange &amp; Trading Client (Zerodha)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build the two halves interviewers mix together: an exchange order book that matches buy and sell orders by price, then time, with partial fills; and a broker app (think Zerodha or Groww) that holds users' cash and shares, blocks funds before an order, and settles each trade. Runnable in Java, Python and C++.</p>\n  <div class=\"chips\">\n    <span class=\"chip company\">Groww</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Meesho</span><span class=\"chip company\">Uber</span><span class=\"chip company\">MakeMyTrip</span><span class=\"chip company\">Navi</span><span class=\"chip company\">Zerodha</span>\n  </div>\n"
